sequenceDiagram
    participant App as Hi Rokid
    participant BLE as Glasses BLE GATT
    participant SDP as Glasses SDP
    participant RFC as Glasses RFCOMM
    participant CXR as CXR runtime

    App->>BLE: Connect and negotiate MTU
    App->>BLE: Read characteristic 0x9301
    BLE-->>App: Runtime UUID + Classic address + opaque account material
    App-->>BLE: Close GATT client
    App->>SDP: Resolve runtime UUID
    SDP-->>App: RFCOMM SCN 3
    App->>RFC: L2CAP 0x007f ↔ 0x0044
    App->>RFC: Multiplexer SABM/UA
    App->>RFC: DLCI 6 SABM/UA, MTU 990
    RFC-->>App: Socket open
    App->>CXR: BLUETOOTH_AVAILABLE
    CXR->>RFC: Initial request burst
